`n` enlarges the unique-witness language; `copies` independently enlarges the
paper graph without changing the answer. One further escalation to `n=58,
copies=5` is possible at 298 intended operations. Beyond it the 300-operation
G9(c) cap, rather than the answer-length cap, is binding.

